+# TLS Certificate Verification in Development Builds
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on TLS certificate verification in development builds. A decision record on this topic (`config/decisions/revoke-tls-verification.json`) previously existed in the repository but was removed when decision configuration was moved out of the tree, and no replacement decision has been recorded since; until a new decision is made and recorded, no policy should be assumed either way.
